id: pm-npr3
title: Consolidate workspace customization discovery and commands under workspace with permanent compatibility aliases
description: "Resolve how init, config, schema, and profile map into the simplified noun grammar so workspace customization stays discoverable without multiplying top-level commands."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 3
