acceptance_criteria: "ADR pm-pbyu's grammar table gains an explicit mapping for init, config, schema, and profile (kept, merged, or verb-moved) with rationale; overlaps are resolved on paper (schema presets vs profile archetypes vs config keys); if any spelling moves, follow-up wiring items are filed under pm-n7rr with alias shims per pm-0z7n; Implement the declared workspace init/config/schema/profile routes through the SDK alias registry with permanent root compatibility and persistent npm/Bun acceptance"
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Consolidated init/config/schema/profile under workspace through the SDK alias registry with permanent root compatibility, stable SDK/MCP identities, canonical recovery/discovery/completion and explicit optional authoring ownership; aligned the real package-first smoke probe with canonical discovery."
expected_result: Canonical customization must preserve persistent SDK behavior and legacy invocations while bounded discovery and installed-package authoring pass real acceptance gates.
actual_result: "130 original linked tests and 39 corrective orchestration tests passed. Exact full-source 100/100/100/100 and hosted coverage/static gates passed on 107989a86. The corrective 89-command package journey passed directly and through pm, and Claude/plugin-cache smokes passed. npm/npx and Bun/bunx packed acceptance passed; corrective-head hosted checks and bot review remain required before merge."
